# Binary dependencies are NOT committed. Download them from the official
# sources listed in BUILD_GUIDE.md and drop them into the Resources folders.

# Extracted stacks the Go installer embeds at build time - fetch, don't commit.
**/Resources/apache_unzipped/
**/Resources/php_unzipped/

# The one exception: the small OpenSSL helper used to mint local SSL certs.
!Go/DesktopServerSetupGo/Resources/openssl.exe

# Specific build artifacts and temporary files
*.cache
*.log
temp_apache/
temp_pma/

